(7501197, 1195392, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very well put together, perfect editing also, top 3.</td>', 'Very well put together, perfect editing also, top 3.', '2017-02-21 06:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501200, 1195435, 114285, '<td valign="top">So quirky, I love it! My top pick~</td>', 'So quirky, I love it! My top pick~', '2017-02-21 06:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501213, 1195408, 182284, '<td valign="top">I love the technique, colors and comp. This photo really beckon you to have a closer look. 8</td>', 'I love the technique, colors and comp. This photo really beckon you to have a closer look. 8', '2017-02-21 09:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501216, 1195392, 182284, '<td valign="top">Very interesting technique. This does make you take a closer look.7</td>', 'Very interesting technique. This does make you take a closer look.7', '2017-02-21 09:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501218, 1194122, 182284, '<td valign="top">I really like this technique. Every time I see one of these it makes me smile. Some days in the kitchen I feel like this photo.</td>', 'I really like this technique. Every time I see one of these it makes me smile. Some days in the kitchen I feel like this photo.', '2017-02-21 09:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501219, 1195086, 182284, '<td valign="top">This gives me the feeling of the twilight zone. Nice photo. 8</td>', 'This gives me the feeling of the twilight zone. Nice photo. 8', '2017-02-21 09:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501220, 1195065, 182284, '<td valign="top">Very sweet photo. Well constructed.</td>', 'Very sweet photo. Well constructed.', '2017-02-21 09:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501221, 1195343, 182284, '<td valign="top">Looks like my favorite candy store.</td>', 'Looks like my favorite candy store.', '2017-02-21 09:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501222, 1195228, 182284, '<td valign="top">Nice comp and construction.</td>', 'Nice comp and construction.', '2017-02-21 09:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501223, 1195326, 182284, '<td valign="top">This would make a beautiful piece of fabric made of peach skin. Love the colors and abstract comp.</td>', 'This would make a beautiful piece of fabric made of peach skin. Love the colors and abstract comp.', '2017-02-21 09:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501230, 1194786, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. I like that you included goo foreground and background.</td>', 'This is really nice. I like that you included goo foreground and background.', '2017-02-21 10:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501231, 1195284, 114225, '<td valign="top">Just not a fan of using selective saturation here.</td>', 'Just not a fan of using selective saturation here.', '2017-02-21 10:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501232, 1195374, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great scene. I like that you capture the meteor. But the image doesn''t look fully focused to me.</td>', 'Great scene. I like that you capture the meteor. But the image doesn''t look fully focused to me.', '2017-02-21 10:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501233, 1195432, 114225, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I had previously voted this lower. Bringing up a few notches because it''s really great lighting and composition.</td>', 'For some reason, I had previously voted this lower. Bringing up a few notches because it''s really great lighting and composition.', '2017-02-21 10:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501235, 1195263, 114225, '<td valign="top">The bokeh of this lens is really distracting. Or maybe that could have came from the editing? Maybe you pushed the clarity high and that may have ruing the silky smooth background.</td>', 'The bokeh of this lens is really distracting. Or maybe that could have came from the editing? Maybe you pushed the clarity high and that may have ruing the silky smooth background.', '2017-02-21 10:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501240, 1194962, 150202, '<td valign="top">The foreground doesn''t stand out from the background for this picture to grab me. Pretty brown colors!</td>', 'The foreground doesn''t stand out from the background for this picture to grab me. Pretty brown colors!', '2017-02-21 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501243, 1195367, 150202, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. I would''ve liked to see the creatures on the mountain in behind the trees more. You know, to make it more realistic! Ha, fun photo!</td>', 'Cute picture. I would''ve liked to see the creatures on the mountain in behind the trees more. You know, to make it more realistic! Ha, fun photo!', '2017-02-21 10:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501246, 1195182, 150202, '<td valign="top">Seems kind of washed out to me, the black isn''t very dark. Nice composition.</td>', 'Seems kind of washed out to me, the black isn''t very dark. Nice composition.', '2017-02-21 10:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501248, 1195263, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors on the pretty and soft background. The angle of the flower also adds interest that you don''t see on your usual flower pic. Very nice!</td>', 'I like the bright colors on the pretty and soft background. The angle of the flower also adds interest that you don''t see on your usual flower pic. Very nice!', '2017-02-21 10:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501254, 1195409, 156466, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a lot more about playing with Photoshop filters than about anything to do with photography. Not my cup of tea regardless. Choosing not to vote rather than toss it a score.</td>', 'Seems to be a lot more about playing with Photoshop filters than about anything to do with photography. Not my cup of tea regardless. Choosing not to vote rather than toss it a score.', '2017-02-21 10:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501256, 1195367, 156466, '<td valign="top">The composite is just way too random for me. It''s not done badly, but it''s also not done in a way that convinces me it''s something.</td>', 'The composite is just way too random for me. It''s not done badly, but it''s also not done in a way that convinces me it''s something.', '2017-02-21 10:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501259, 1195432, 156466, '<td valign="top">Easily a stop dark. Falls flat and the OOF plant in the front is more distracting than anything. Other than being dark the processing is nicely done.</td>', 'Easily a stop dark. Falls flat and the OOF plant in the front is more distracting than anything. Other than being dark the processing is nicely done.', '2017-02-21 10:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501261, 1195065, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting and well processed, but the couple needs to occupy more of the shot. I''d imagine in a large frame on the wall this works fine but not on a MacBook screen</td>', 'Lovely setting and well processed, but the couple needs to occupy more of the shot. I''d imagine in a large frame on the wall this works fine but not on a MacBook screen', '2017-02-21 10:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501263, 1194338, 163081, '<td valign="top">Looks like a terminal for time travelers. Could make the cover of a SF book. An 8 from me</td>', 'Looks like a terminal for time travelers. Could make the cover of a SF book. An 8 from me', '2017-02-21 10:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501264, 1195284, 156466, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the symmetric reflection but there''s just too much of it and it loses its effectiveness in the competition. You could probably crop in at multiple points within this shot and have something more interesting, but this is just OK.</td>', 'I like the idea of the symmetric reflection but there''s just too much of it and it loses its effectiveness in the competition. You could probably crop in at multiple points within this shot and have something more interesting, but this is just OK.', '2017-02-21 10:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501265, 1195263, 156466, '<td valign="top">You''ve WAY oversharpened here, perhaps trying to enhance areas that are out of focus? Still, you want to avoid or at least fix all those halos.</td>', 'You''ve WAY oversharpened here, perhaps trying to enhance areas that are out of focus? Still, you want to avoid or at least fix all those halos.', '2017-02-21 10:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501266, 1195432, 163081, '<td valign="top">There is something in this picture that makes me look for a long time. I give you a 7.</td>', 'There is something in this picture that makes me look for a long time. I give you a 7.', '2017-02-21 10:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501268, 1195433, 163081, '<td valign="top">Time travelers ready to be sucked in the transporter</td>', 'Time travelers ready to be sucked in the transporter', '2017-02-21 10:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501269, 1195424, 156466, '<td valign="top">This is really nicely processed but not really interesting outside of the cool factor (no pun intended) of the subject. In other words the overall visual impact isn''t there for me. I''m assuming this is a single image and not a composite, but if it was put together I think you would have been better served with just doing one malformed snowflake.</td>', 'This is really nicely processed but not really interesting outside of the cool factor (no pun intended) of the subject. In other words the overall visual impact isn''t there for me. I''m assuming this is a single image and not a composite, but if it was put together I think you would have been better served with just doing one malformed snowflake.', '2017-02-21 10:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501270, 1195335, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nicely assembled and imagined composite. I''ll pick some nits for future reference: the sharp edge at the top of the water busts the illusion, the tree could stand out some more, and you could do with less wasted space around the subject. Nice work nonetheless.</td>', 'Nicely assembled and imagined composite. I''ll pick some nits for future reference: the sharp edge at the top of the water busts the illusion, the tree could stand out some more, and you could do with less wasted space around the subject. Nice work nonetheless.', '2017-02-21 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501271, 1195086, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the selective color and it''s a little flat from a contrast standpoint. Fans at the top are distracting so you''d better served to crop at least down if not in. Otherwise nicely seen and executed. Maybe instead of the selective color next time, shoot one with and one without and remove either the man or the refection for added impact?</td>', 'Not a fan of the selective color and it''s a little flat from a contrast standpoint. Fans at the top are distracting so you''d better served to crop at least down if not in. Otherwise nicely seen and executed. Maybe instead of the selective color next time, shoot one with and one without and remove either the man or the refection for added impact?', '2017-02-21 10:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501272, 1194741, 163081, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. An 8 from me</td>', 'I like this very much. An 8 from me', '2017-02-21 10:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501273, 1194786, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot and processed. Maybe you could have pulled out a little more of the shadow detail to help define the lines between the hills and water.</td>', 'Nicely shot and processed. Maybe you could have pulled out a little more of the shadow detail to help define the lines between the hills and water.', '2017-02-21 10:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501275, 1195315, 156466, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if the checkered pattern is photoshopped or not. If it is it''s not convincing. If it''s not then processing is a bit weird. It''s visually very striking, but also more than a little off for me. Not scoring this one.</td>', 'I can''t decide if the checkered pattern is photoshopped or not. If it is it''s not convincing. If it''s not then processing is a bit weird. It''s visually very striking, but also more than a little off for me. Not scoring this one.', '2017-02-21 10:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501276, 1195427, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nicely assembled composite. Next step is to get the shadows and highlights consistent. Everything is placed nicely but the cat needs some lighting and contrast adjustments to better match the rest. And don''t forget when the books cast a shadow so does the cat.</td>', 'Nicely assembled composite. Next step is to get the shadows and highlights consistent. Everything is placed nicely but the cat needs some lighting and contrast adjustments to better match the rest. And don''t forget when the books cast a shadow so does the cat.', '2017-02-21 11:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501278, 1195228, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nicely assembled and processed composite. Nits to pick for next time: 1) if there''s motion in some of the droplets then perhaps just a touch of motion blur to at least one of the falling cookies, 2) cookie entry point doesn''t match the splash, 3) falling things seldom all fall parallel to the viewing plane, so some variety of angles for the top two falling cookies would make it more convincing, 4) feels too empty - lower the shelf, push in a bit, increase the impact of the action area.</td>', 'Nicely assembled and processed composite. Nits to pick for next time: 1) if there''s motion in some of the droplets then perhaps just a touch of motion blur to at least one of the falling cookies, 2) cookie entry point doesn''t match the splash, 3) falling things seldom all fall parallel to the viewing plane, so some variety of angles for the top two falling cookies would make it more convincing, 4) feels too empty - lower the shelf, push in a bit, increase the impact of the action area.', '2017-02-21 11:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501280, 1194154, 156466, '<td valign="top">When I have a lovely sunset like this I have the tendency to really oversaturate the reds, oranges, and yellows. I''m not the only one. I might have pulled back on the structure of the clouds a little though that level does work for the water. Lovely photo, just a touch heavy handed with the processing.</td>', 'When I have a lovely sunset like this I have the tendency to really oversaturate the reds, oranges, and yellows. I''m not the only one. I might have pulled back on the structure of the clouds a little though that level does work for the water. Lovely photo, just a touch heavy handed with the processing.', '2017-02-21 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501281, 1195149, 156466, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot</td>', 'Like it a lot', '2017-02-21 11:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501283, 1194122, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really clean composite but just a little too disjoint for me to feel either real or convincingly surreal. Technically excellent in the assembly, but it feels like everything got it''s own area and outside of shadows no two objects occupy a shared space - so it looks exactly like a composite. Great effort, just needs to come together differently. Can''t reward it but don''t want to kick it, so no vote.</td>', 'Really clean composite but just a little too disjoint for me to feel either real or convincingly surreal. Technically excellent in the assembly, but it feels like everything got it''s own area and outside of shadows no two objects occupy a shared space - so it looks exactly like a composite. Great effort, just needs to come together differently. Can''t reward it but don''t want to kick it, so no vote.', '2017-02-21 11:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501284, 1194915, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great idea but something like this needs to <i><b>POP</b></i> and this just falls flat. Looks like you accidentally blew out the highlights in the pepper and instead of reshooting you tried to fix it. I applaud you for not oversaturating, and the flame lettering is really well done. Top half gets a 7, bottom half a 5.</td>', 'Great idea but something like this needs to POP and this just falls flat. Looks like you accidentally blew out the highlights in the pepper and instead of reshooting you tried to fix it. I applaud you for not oversaturating, and the flame lettering is really well done. Top half gets a 7, bottom half a 5.', '2017-02-21 11:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501285, 1195240, 156466, '<td valign="top">You mean vulture ;)</td>', 'You mean vulture ;)', '2017-02-21 11:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7501287, 1195410, 156466, '<td valign="top">All sorts of overprocessing going on here, from blown out yellows to wringing details out of something that really doesn''t need the details wrung out of it. Plus you''ve got a black ring around it that needs to be extended to the ends. No vote, just a gentle reminder to go easy on flowers</td>', 'All sorts of overprocessing going on here, from blown out yellows to wringing details out of something that really doesn''t need the details wrung out of it. Plus you''ve got a black ring around it that needs to be extended to the ends. No vote, just a gentle reminder to go easy on flowers', '2017-02-21 11:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
