(7501544, 1195122, 104920, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> he is posing so beautifully for you. this is a world, or a story, in a photograph, and I like how the photo has such ease fitting it all in. It''s the spatial equivalent of not hurrying.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077285.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077285.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077285.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your appreciation Don!</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: he is posing so beautifully for you. this is a world, or a story, in a photograph, and I like how the photo has such ease fitting it all in. It''s the spatial equivalent of not hurrying. Posthumous Red Ribbon    Thank you for your appreciation Don!', '2017-02-22 01:38:28.000000', NULL, 0),
