(7501643, 1195374, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ah, no wonder it doesn''t look fully focused, it''s the Rokinon 14mm. I have that thing too, and it''s ok, but definitely has issues outside ofthe center on full frame.<br/> <br/>I''m really excited to start seeing sample images from that new Sigma 14mm 1.8 Art lens. If the other Art lenses are any indication, that will be an amazing piece of glass.</td>', 'Ah, no wonder it doesn''t look fully focused, it''s the Rokinon 14mm. I have that thing too, and it''s ok, but definitely has issues outside ofthe center on full frame. I''m really excited to start seeing sample images from that new Sigma 14mm 1.8 Art lens. If the other Art lenses are any indication, that will be an amazing piece of glass.', '2017-02-22 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7501647, 1195318, 183150, '<td valign="top">This picture feels like the start to a great story.</td>', 'This picture feels like the start to a great story.', '2017-02-22 11:33:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7501656, 1195427, 118154, '<td valign="top">very tidy</td>', 'very tidy', '2017-02-22 12:25:44.000000', NULL, 0),
