(7501732, 1195374, 1031, '<td valign="top">I really like the amount of foreground detail you were able to capture/retain, along with the great stars and perfectly-placed meteor. I haven''t been any place like that for a long time. :-(</td>', 'I really like the amount of foreground detail you were able to capture/retain, along with the great stars and perfectly-placed meteor. I haven''t been any place like that for a long time. :-(', '2017-02-22 16:53:51.000000', NULL, 0),
