(7501854, 1195435, 68504, '<td valign="top">this was in my handful of better shots that I never got around to bumping up or commenting on. visually meditative; doesn''t need a title, but we know the sweet siren song of puns.<br/> <br/>thanks for sharing your M O, your "too common strategy."  more common than one might think. or not.<br/> <br/>And such a nice echo of the man with the elephant. Maybe we humans are learning to think.</td>', 'this was in my handful of better shots that I never got around to bumping up or commenting on. visually meditative; doesn''t need a title, but we know the sweet siren song of puns. thanks for sharing your M O, your "too common strategy."  more common than one might think. or not. And such a nice echo of the man with the elephant. Maybe we humans are learning to think.', '2017-02-23 15:24:31.000000', NULL, 0),
